---
import baseline from "../../data/content-baseline.json";
import EquipmentFilm from "./EquipmentFilm.astro";
import NewsletterSubscription from "./NewsletterSubscription.astro";
import {localizedDocumentPath} from "../../lib/localized-documents.mjs";
const {locale="en"}=Astro.props;
---
<main id="main"><div class="wrap"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">volvet</a> / Resources</p><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Source-derived / Actually available</p><h1>Specifications to read.<br/>Questions to resolve.</h1><p class="lead muted">Download the current specification summary and prepare the documents needed for a project review. These files do not replace reviewed operating instructions.</p></header><section class="download-list" aria-label="Available documents"><article><span class="kicker">01 / SPECIFICATION SUMMARY / {baseline.version}</span><h2>Equipment facts,<br/>with their limits.</h2><p>A machine-readable and spreadsheet-readable summary of the supplied S4 specification sheet: dimensions, weights, power, included components and labelled manufacturer-reported performance.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={localizedDocumentPath("volvet-specifications.csv",locale)} download data-download="spec-csv">Download CSV ↓</a><a class="text-link" href={localizedDocumentPath("volvet-specifications.json",locale)} download data-download="spec-json">Download JSON ↓</a></div><p class="note">Source-derived summary, not a certificate, reviewed manual or field-test report. Source operating wording remains under engineering review.</p></article><article><span class="kicker">02 / PROJECT INFORMATION / BLANK WORKSHEET</span><h2>Prepare a useful<br/>project brief.</h2><p>A blank worksheet for the destination, pole assembly, flange, foundation, site and open questions. Add references to your own drawings; unknown items can remain open.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={localizedDocumentPath("project-information-worksheet.csv",locale)} download data-download="worksheet">Download worksheet ↓</a><a class="text-link" href="/guides/pole-jack-compatibility/">Review the information checklist ↗</a></div></article></section>
<section class="section resource-film"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Visual reference</p><h2>Read the numbers.<br/>See the equipment.</h2><p class="muted" style="margin-top:24px">An overview of the lifting assembly, hydraulic details, connection and packing, made from the current reference library.</p><a class="text-link" style="margin-top:24px" href="/products/light-pole-jack/">Explore the equipment ↗</a></div><EquipmentFilm locale={locale} id="resources-equipment-film"/></section>
<section class="section"><div class="two-column"><div><p class="eyebrow">Documents that need confirmation</p><h2>Ask for the records<br/>your project needs.</h2></div><div><p>Reviewed operating instructions, dimensioned connection drawings, compliance documents and warranty or delivery arrangements are not presented as completed downloads here. State the requirement and destination so the available evidence can be checked.</p><p>The original S4 image is retained as an internal fact source. Its unreviewed operating sections are not repackaged as a finished manual.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact-us/?inquiryType=support">Request project documents ↗</a></div></div></div></section><NewsletterSubscription locale={locale} sourcePage="/resources/"/></div></main>
<script>document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-download]").forEach(a=>a.addEventListener("click",()=>document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("volvet:download-spec",{detail:{document:a.dataset.download,page:location.pathname}}))));</script>

<style>.resource-film{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:60px;align-items:center;padding-bottom:0}.resource-film h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.2vw,44px)}@media(max-width:760px){.resource-film{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}}</style>
